description:
Highlights from our ROAR Story Slam 2026!

On Saturday, April 18th, Korean American Story brought together an unforgettable evening of storytelling, vulnerability, and joy at @racketnewyork for ROAR Story Slam 2026.

This year’s storytellers took the stage to share bold, deeply personal stories shaped by this year’s theme, Joy. With no scripts, no props, just a mic and their truth, each performance resonated with a sold-out audience through moments of vulnerability, humor, and heart.

Hosted by Emmy-nominated puppeteer @kafode, with Q&A moderated by journalist @vivlee88, and music by DJ @junginbabyy, the night was a powerful reflection of the depth and range of Korean American storytelling.

Shout out to our incredible storytellers:
@julieyeeun @mikkamusic @poorly_drawn_plans @epopski @goodgrayces @hkbarnes96

